--- stdout
Cross-file structural query with composable filters

Usage: mdd find [OPTIONS] <DIR>

Arguments:
  <DIR>  Directory to search

Options:
  -t, --type <TYPE>              Filter by frontmatter 'type' field value
      --topic <TOPIC>            Filter by frontmatter 'topic' field value
  -H, --heading <HEADING>        Filter by heading pattern (substring match)
      --has-table                Only files containing at least one table
      --has-code <HAS_CODE>      Only files containing code blocks in the specified language
      --newer-than <NEWER_THAN>  Only files modified after this date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  -f, --format <FORMAT>          Output format: human (colored), agent (provenance+signature), json [possible values: human, agent, json]
      --strict                   Fail on first malformed file instead of skipping with a warning
      --all-files                Include AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CLAUDE.local.md and README.md in directory scans
  -h, --help                     Print help (see more with '--help')
--- stderr

